mydotfiles — run: dots

Keyboard
  Linux/WSL (fzf widget)
    Ctrl-R   fuzzy history
    Ctrl-T   fuzzy file → insert path
    Alt-C    fuzzy directory → cd
  Inside any fzf picker
    type to filter · ↑/↓ or Ctrl-J/K · Enter select · Esc cancel
  PowerShell
    Ctrl-R   PSReadLine history search
    bins     fuzzy pick a command on PATH (needs fzf)

Navigation (zoxide)
  z src          jump to frecent dir matching "src"
  z proj app     match multiple tokens
  zi             interactive picker (also uses fzf if present)
  (no cd override — plain cd still works)

Tool versions & runtimes (mise)
  mise ls / mise ls-remote <tool>
  mise install                install tools from global config / project mise.toml
  mise exec -- <cmd>          run with project tool versions
  Global pins: python, node, bun, omp, agy-crew, copier, rg, fd, delta, zoxide,
               just, uv, yq, fnox, rbw (Linux) / bw (Win), betterleaks
  Optional toolsets (.chezmoidata.toml): infra (tofu, kubectl), containers (helm), rust
  Profiles: workstation (default), server (no AI tools), ephemeral (containers)

Repo task runner (just) — from mydotfiles checkout
  just                        list repo recipes
  just check | test           run full CI suite (scripts/ci-check.sh)
  just test-fast              CI suite skipping network checks
  just apply / diff / update  chezmoi against this checkout
  just render-rules           render agent-core.md → agent/cursor-user-rules.md
  just scan-secrets           run betterleaks git scan
  just install-hooks          install pre-commit hooks
  just dots                   print this cheat sheet

Global agent & project runner (just -g) — from any directory
  just -g                     list global recipes (~/.justfile)
  just -g doctor              audit env, active stack, version pins, vault & secrets
  just -g seed [lang] [arch]  scaffold AGENTS.md + .agent-profile.md
                              seeds: python, typescript-node, systems-shell, minimal
                              archetypes: infra-ops, agent-cli, data-pipeline, legacy-port
  just -g agent-init [arch]   attach .agent-profile.md to current repo
  just -g plan "<task>"       generate .agent-spec.md via omp (plan-only)
  just -g omp-run [args...]   run omp with repo .agent-profile.md & .agent-spec.md
  just -g worktree-new <br>   create sibling worktree ../wt-<br>
  just -g worktree-done <br>  remove clean sibling worktree

Project scaffolding (Copier — default ref: v0.1.0)
  just -g new <dir> [--archetype infra-ops] [--company <name>] [--ref <tag>]
  just -g adopt [dir] [--archetype infra-ops] [--company <name>] [--ref <tag>]
  copier update --answers-file .copier-answers.base.yml --UNSAFE
  copier update --answers-file .copier-answers.infra-ops.yml --UNSAFE
  Templates:
    copier-base       https://github.com/AmazingHorse/copier-base
    copier-infra-ops  https://github.com/AmazingHorse/copier-infra-ops

Secrets (fnox + Bitwarden)
  rbw login && rbw unlock     unlock vault on Linux/WSL (Windows: bw unlock)
  fnox check / fnox doctor    verify secret refs in fnox.toml / check provider
  fnox exec -- <cmd>          run command with project secrets injected (folder: proj)
  ~/.config/agent-secrets.env global agent keys rendered by chezmoi (item: ai-agent-keys)

Search
  rg TODO                    content search (smart-case, hidden, skip .git)
  rg -t py HTTPError         by type
  rg -g '*.toml' pin         by glob
  fd readme                  find files by name
  fd -e md                   by extension
  fd -t d config             directories only
  bins                       fuzzy list executables on PATH

Git (delta pager is automatic)
  git diff | git show | git log -p | git lg
  git st · co · sw · br · ci · last · lg · amend
  gsw / gco                  fzf branch → switch / checkout

Editor / pager
  $EDITOR   preferred-editor (Cursor → Antigravity → VS Code → nvim/vim/vi)
  PAGER     less -FRX when available

SSH
  just setup-ssh [--gh] [--gl] [-i path] [host...]
  ssh-copy-id | copy-ssh-id [-i path] host

Bootstrap
  ./scripts/bootstrap.sh | .\scripts\bootstrap.ps1   [--ssh|-Ssh] [-SkipWsl]
